OL,7,FOn a busy day for the royals, the
OL,8,FPrince and Princess of Wales are out
OL,9,Fand about on the Isle of Bute, while
OL,10,Fthe Duke of Sussex is expected to
OL,11,Fattend an Invictus Games event in
OL,12,FLondon
OL,14,FIt's the first time all four are out in
OL,15,Fpublic since Prince Harry and Meghan
OL,16,Freturned to the UK - the Sussexes
OL,17,Fremain non-working royals
OL,19,FMeanwhile, a row has erupted between
OL,20,FBuckingham Palace and Earl Spencer,
OL,21,FPrincess Diana's brother, over claims
OL,22,Fhe makes about the King in a new memoir
